{"id": "doc-01", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une équipe peut aligner au maximum onze joueurs sur le terrain [ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-8-du-football#balle-a-terre/2", "ifab-loi-03#7-personne-supplementaire-sur-le-terrain/1", "ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/5"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 986, "tokens_out": 32, "latency_s": 78.13842401900001, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-02", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1] Un match ne peut pas commencer ou continuer si une équipe dispose de moins de sept joueurs.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/2", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/11", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 738, "tokens_out": 38, "latency_s": 1.1100046159999977, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-03", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1] Le nombre maximal de remplacements autorisés dans le cadre de tout match de compétition officielle ne pourra être supérieur à cinq.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/1", "ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/4", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/2", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 938, "tokens_out": 44, "latency_s": 1.5911187190000078, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-04", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La circonférence du ballon doit être comprise entre 68 et 70 cm [ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1", "wiki-ballon-de-football#introduction/1", "wiki-ballon-de-football#historique/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1187, "tokens_out": 35, "latency_s": 1.1780065190000073, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-05", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le poids du ballon au début du match doit être compris entre 410 et 450 g [ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#introduction/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1170, "tokens_out": 38, "latency_s": 1.0593516039999997, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-06", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions] La longueur minimale de la ligne de touche est de 90 m et la longueur maximale est de 120 m.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#dimensions", "ifab-loi-01#4-dimensions-pour-les-matches-internationaux", "ifab-loi-01#2-marquage-du-terrain/2", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#marquage-du-terrain/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1007, "tokens_out": 41, "latency_s": 1.015695873999988, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-07", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les lignes de la surface de réparation sont tracées à 16,5 m de l’intérieur de chaque poteau du but [ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1", "ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/2", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/2", "ifab-loi-01#5-surface-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 849, "tokens_out": 46, "latency_s": 0.9390658449999876, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-08", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque période d'un match dure 45 minutes [ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#periodes-de-jeu", "ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#arret-definitif-du-match/2", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#introduction"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 716, "tokens_out": 30, "latency_s": 0.9270999389999872, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-09", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La pause entre les deux périodes ne doit pas dépasser 15 minutes [ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#mi-temps", "ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#periodes-de-jeu", "ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 813, "tokens_out": 32, "latency_s": 4.903946107000024, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-10", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un corner est accordé [ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1", "ifab-loi-12#3-corner/2", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#corner/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/3", "wiki-corner-football#procedure"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 883, "tokens_out": 20, "latency_s": 7.238729483999975, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-11", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les adversaires doivent se trouver à au moins 9,15 m du ballon [ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-12#2-coup-franc-indirect/6", "ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#coup-franc-direct/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/6"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 932, "tokens_out": 33, "latency_s": 7.755082519999974, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-12", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ifab-loi-15#introduction] Un coup de pied de but doit être accordé.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-15#introduction"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-15#1-procedure/2", "ifab-loi-15#introduction", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#conditions", "ifab-loi-15#1-procedure/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 916, "tokens_out": 24, "latency_s": 7.9479502649999745, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-13", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Non, il n'y a pas d'infraction de hors-jeu lorsqu'un joueur reçoit le ballon directement sur une rentrée de touche [ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-11-du-football#infraction-de-hors-jeu/8", "ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/8"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 918, "tokens_out": 45, "latency_s": 8.175179100000037, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-14", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les parties du corps prises en compte sont la tête, le tronc et les jambes [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1]. Les mains et les bras ne sont pas pris en compte, la limite supérieure du bras étant le bas de l’aisselle [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1] [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#position-de-hors-jeu", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/3", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1055, "tokens_out": 103, "latency_s": 9.192957300999979, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-15", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "L'arbitre donne un coup de sifflet et signale le début d'un décompte de cinq secondes, qu'il effectue également visuellement main levée [ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1]. Si le coup de pied de but n'a pas été effectué à la fin de ces cinq secondes, un corner est accordé à l'équipe adverse [ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1]. Le joueur ayant commis l'infraction n'est averti que s'il retarde excessivement la reprise du jeu après que le corner a été accordé [ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1", "ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/4", "ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#coup-de-pied-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1015, "tokens_out": 156, "latency_s": 9.167549479999991, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-16", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3] Au moment du tir, le gardien de but doit avoir au moins un pied sur ou derrière sa ligne (ou au même niveau si le pied ne touche pas le sol).\n[wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1] Le gardien de but doit rester sur sa ligne de but, face au tireur et entre les poteaux avant que le tir ne soit effectué.", "sources": ["ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/2", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 964, "tokens_out": 93, "latency_s": 8.001896775000034, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-17", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque équipe exécute d'abord cinq tirs au but [wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1].", "sources": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-tirs-au-but#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/9", "wiki-tirs-au-but#handball"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1067, "tokens_out": 33, "latency_s": 9.096985189999998, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.3333333333333333, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
